Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.85,0:00:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Geratsu, your eyes are rolled all\Nthe way into the back of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, how could you expect\Nto see anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now how's your vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is, that puny creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of those blue sea\Ndwellers. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought it was a raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raccoon dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's nothing like a wild animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He walks upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is unquestionably a creature\Nthat comes from the blue sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.49,0:00:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:00:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where we're supposed to meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lonely and I'm getting\Na little freaked out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scary Creepy Dice Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:02:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.57,0:02:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.11,0:02:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage to sail and believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.71,0:02:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.90,0:02:31.07,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.90,0:02:31.07,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.49,0:02:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.44,0:02:36.36,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.44,0:02:36.36,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams,\Nthings have changed now,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.45,0:02:41.70,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.45,0:02:41.70,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.70,0:02:48.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.70,0:02:48.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where the compass points our\Ndestiny, there's no looking back,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.46,0:02:52.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.46,0:02:52.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.48,0:03:08.10,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.48,0:03:08.10,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.10,0:03:12.15,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.10,0:03:12.15,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Gordingus\NRavenfire\NWestfal\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried only helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.24,0:03:17.70,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.24,0:03:17.70,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Chloelyy\NFunimation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.75,0:03:35.59,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,700)\fscx93\fscy93\fsp-1\bord1.8\c&H000500&\3c&H000500&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(773,0)\q2\t(731,773,\1a&H00&)}Pirate Chopper vs. Priest Gedatsu
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.75,0:03:35.59,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,700)\fscx93\fscy93\fsp-1\bord0\c&HFAFAFA&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(773,0)\q2}Pirate Chopper vs. Priest Gedatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I plan on staying that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could that kid have run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter, I shouldn't be\Nwasting my energy on him anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a more important battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of my strength needs to be saved\Nif I'm going to win my fight with Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm certain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I use the Reject one more time, my\Nbody will be reduced to a pile of ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed our Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.87,0:05:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish Chopper was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't supposed to be this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're checking his right\Nside for a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The left side is where his heart is.
