Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's still not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't die again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.91,0:05:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:06:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did to him, but you\Nbetter not try any more monkey business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will stay quiet, or join your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I being clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.61,0:06:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What wicked reason could you\Npossibly have for coming aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the six years\NI've been on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've kept your former\Nsubordinates very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been slaving away\Nfor me all these long years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they've hardly had a moment to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My divine warriors have\Nbeen reduced to slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are most extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly, they are of great talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it appears that their\Nyears of hard labor are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, this island is\Nno longer useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consequently, I no longer require the\Nservices of your former divine warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you suspect that I have\Nsinister motives in coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have simply come to bid\Nyou farewell, that is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I envy the blissful,\Ninnocent stupidity of Skypiea's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fools here can only see this island as
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing more than a clump\Nof earth in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all these years you never guessed the\Ntrue reason we seized this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason the Blue Sea Flies are\Nhere meddling in the island's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the reason the Shandians fight so\Nbravely to return to their sacred homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, all this is happening\Nfor one purpose and one alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is something here\Nthat they all seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great treasures of\NShandora, the legendary
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,city of gold that\Nprospered on the blue sea
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so Long ago gold is\Nwhat brings us all here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is gold and why is\Nit so important to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ignorance never\Nceases to amaze the only
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people in the world who\Nknow nothing of gold
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or its value live in the midst of untold
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fortune you didn't even\Nknow what the goal was so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how Could you have won\Nthis game interestingly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough our game of\Nsurvival is in its final
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,play Whoever wins gets
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the goal can you hear it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now the sounds of our\Nlively little competition
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I'm a\Ncontestant myself, so I must be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Divine Warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to set them free?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God only knows, and he's not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eneru, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These weaklings aren't worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exquisite ammunition you have there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matter that dents does not\Nnaturally exist here in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The birth mineral called iron, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have managed to make\Nquick work of my men,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is a difficult\Ntask to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, my guess is that you are\Nthe great Shandora warrior, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander Yama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I refuse to die not like this, not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:11:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here oh still alive I see you are tough
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well as a gesture of respect for your\Nwarrior spirit I will end your suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my secret technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dance attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Yama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Axe Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet, so very far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:12:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the Deputy Divine Commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed our Brother Sartre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.47,0:12:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't killed anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Hotari!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can call me Katorea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you guys killed our\Nbeloved big brother Satori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to burst your bubble,\Nbut I don't know your brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.11,0:12:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're all gonna pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must deal with these two quickly\Nand return to the business at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to find Enel and rescue my divine\Nwarriors before the unthinkable happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.81,0:13:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, stand back, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be injured, but I'd never\Nlose to the likes of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't stand back this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because sometimes I'm the one\Nwho has to protect my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First we need to determine\Nwhich tiles they possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to avenge our brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to avenge our brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A memorial to the city itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:14:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its descendants built it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after the great city fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.67,0:14:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the name of this ancient place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,402 SE.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.97,0:14:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city was at its peak 1100\Nyears ago, but then it toppled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Around 800 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That time frame almost\Nperfectly matches the 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of history that vanished\Nfrom the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this island holds the key, the\Nkey to a long forgotten history that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Veiled from the world below this is a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Complete map of Shandora. Perhaps I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,learn more about this blank century if I\Ngo to the center of the city who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a beautiful young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A consuming technique, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes are rolled back in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's really spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get at you, you can't see the enemy\Nwith your eyes roll back like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An enemy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now He must\Nbe one of Enuru's priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Alto, priest in\Nthe service of Almighty Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I command the Upper\NYard's ordeal of the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:15:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, say something, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geratsu, he can't hear you\Nunless you speak out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't normally forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I advise you to watch where you step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See this entire area is my territory to\Ncontrol all around us are swamp clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once you find yourself\Ntrapped by one there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is no hope of escape the\Nsurvival rate here is 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost a tragic ordeal of the swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has no effect on me. Swamp Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's shooting something out of\Nhis feet that makes him fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming out of his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One stinking matted raccoon dog\Nis hardly worth my precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swamp Cloud Burger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.53,0:17:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A deadly swamp with the weight of a cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.39,0:17:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once touched, nothing can survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.37,0:17:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! No! Get out soon!\NDon't aim it at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.65,0:17:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a cloud, so if you try to lift it,\Nyour hands will pass right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more you struggle to get free, the\Ndeeper you're dragged inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swamp Cloud Burger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one of those things hits\Nme, I'll be dead for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.89,0:18:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're still alive, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, being saved by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic. Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you, Geratsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never serve you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch as my axtile\Ndrains the life from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll team up, and together\Nwe'll defeat him. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is called my jet crunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lethal jet dial\Npunches accelerated with it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allow you to destroy an\Nenemy before they even.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Realize the fight has begun its only real\Ndefect is that it also destroys my clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is a priest if i don't get out of\Nhere right now i'll end up like that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to keep my feet off the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swamp jet things are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I run on top of the ruins only, I can\Nmake it to the forest and solid ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just where do you think you're\Nrunning off to, raccoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's another jet punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:19:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumble! Jumping Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.19,0:20:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bumble Balls last for three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you have Zone-type powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about another one?\NOh, yeah! Weight point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swamp Cloud Burger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why that insolent little...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.19,0:20:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weight point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.43,0:20:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rufflescope!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A weak point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.55,0:20:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gotta have some weak point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything I'll do, I need to\Nfind a weakness and escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jet Punch! Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with my guard up, it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, look in the clouds\Nabove! I can see Giant Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're close to the ruins of Shandora
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inaru's got to be up there somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.19,0:21:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brave Kamakiri of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anaru, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten to\Nwhom you were speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.57,0:21:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am God, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.87,0:21:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know exactly what\Nyou're thinking, warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.97,0:22:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wondering why I came down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need my mantra to read\Nwhat's written all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.13,0:22:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.37,0:22:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally I don't bother to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this time I'm a player\Nin the survival game too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.35,0:22:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'll be leaving this land soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just saying goodbye to Gonfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.57,0:22:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professional courtesy, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.65,0:22:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A game?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.11,0:22:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A game?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also don't need my mantra to tell me that\Nyou'd really like to kill me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.15,0:22:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit you've shown\Ngreat courage in reaching me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.45,0:22:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'd say you're entitled to a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it a display of God's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.97,0:22:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then I'll give you\Nfive minutes for five.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.45,0:23:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,minutes I won't move\Na muscle what I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge your attacks and I won't fight\Nback fry me skewer me I am at your mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you but once those five minutes are\Nup you will know what it means to face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.31,0:23:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God in the very depths of your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.17,0:23:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.23,0:23:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.69,0:23:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.41,0:23:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even see straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still think you can win?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.57,0:23:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs are shaky at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.31,0:23:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the rumble ball is about to wear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.59,0:24:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's time to stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.15,0:24:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.43,0:24:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.39,0:24:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plunk Cloud Burger!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.19,0:24:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always the first to run away, so\Neveryone thinks they have to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.53,0:24:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they can't rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.43,0:24:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to raise a\Npirate flag right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.59,0:24:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know when you've lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.13,0:25:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the air is my territory to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.49,0:25:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't escape. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.63,0:25:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.75,0:25:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.91,0:25:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That raccoon dog took my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.93,0:25:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.77,0:25:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.65,0:25:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.65,0:25:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.23,0:25:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weakest beast roars the loudest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.47,0:25:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last jet punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.13,0:25:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let myself get carried away and\Nnearly lost control of my mantra.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only grazed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.37,0:25:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.37,0:25:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our point!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.37,0:26:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.89,0:26:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.29,0:26:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally I'm one of the pirates' tales!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he fell\Nright into a swamp! Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if he would just stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.47,0:26:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.57,0:26:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.89,0:26:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep on sinking, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.79,0:26:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.63,0:26:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.15,0:27:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I lost to a raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.01,0:27:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the things I could never live down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.07,0:27:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how did I get stuck\Nin my own swamp cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.71,0:27:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't supposed to happen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.41,0:27:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.41,0:27:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, oh please, just stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.25,0:27:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sink! Sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can escape with a milky dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.91,0:27:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he really sank!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.09,0:27:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.41,0:27:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.59,0:27:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.23,0:27:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.07,0:27:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.79,0:27:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.51,0:27:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.41,0:27:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.85,0:27:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.51,0:27:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.85,0:27:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're unconscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.83,0:27:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.43,0:27:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.79,0:28:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys killed our brother Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.03,0:28:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.37,0:28:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.67,0:28:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.03,0:28:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stored my faucet of flavor dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.01,0:28:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.67,0:28:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have four different types of dials\Nthey're using instead of just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.69,0:28:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha! That's right! Us! Flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.17,0:28:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.27,0:28:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.69,0:28:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.29,0:28:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to keep track!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.31,0:28:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is hotery and\Nwhich one is Katorea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.81,0:28:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What dial is in which hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.73,0:28:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun to guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.61,0:28:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise dial illusion! Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.23,0:28:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know what they have, but\Nthere's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.19,0:28:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't care which one of those\Npuffballs was which in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.25,0:29:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suck Typhoon, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.49,0:29:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.61,0:29:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess which dial's in my right hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.41,0:29:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fooled you! More parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.01,0:29:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you expecting flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.07,0:29:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to ignite the gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.25,0:29:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.55,0:29:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's been blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.05,0:29:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a childishly obvious trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.69,0:29:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you underestimated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.75,0:29:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.99,0:29:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cyclone tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.05,0:30:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You... girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.17,0:30:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retrieve my gauntlet from the\Nlower deck and finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.18,0:30:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did your wounds open?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.10,0:30:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget me, he'll be back soon!\NGauntlet? Gauntlet. Gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.03,0:30:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gauntlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.79,0:30:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's a gauntlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.17,0:30:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.55,0:30:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's made of iron from the Blue Sea World.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.55,0:30:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an impact dial inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.99,0:30:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it as I instructed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.43,0:30:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.29,0:30:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can barely lift this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.97,0:30:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no time\Nto worry about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.57,0:30:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First out of the event, coterie! You pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.25,0:30:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.03,0:30:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who uses fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.21,0:30:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sopping wet and the air\Nis full of moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.23,0:30:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.67,0:31:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this? Just cold air?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.77,0:31:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.05,0:31:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, cold air, and you use fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.89,0:31:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.49,0:31:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a little breeze\Ncan extinguish my flame dial?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.47,0:31:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.53,0:31:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hot air flowing\Nover the cold air will
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.87,0:31:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cause the moisture in the air to condense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.55,0:31:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll form a mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.53,0:31:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom! Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.67,0:31:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.99,0:31:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's fog everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.25,0:31:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.93,0:31:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.25,0:31:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.35,0:31:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.03,0:31:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.95,0:32:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that thing nearly blew my arm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.15,0:32:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing, you old fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.01,0:32:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain will pass, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.45,0:32:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must say you were superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.85,0:32:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.73,0:32:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I protected the ship and the crew.

